<title>DENMARK: Danish KommuneKredit issues 200 mln Dkk 4 pct bond.</title>
<headline>Danish KommuneKredit issues 200 mln Dkk 4 pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Monday by arranger and lead manager Gudme Raaschou:</p>
<p>BORROWER: KOMMUNEKREDIT.</p>
<p>AMOUNT: 200 MILLION DANISH CROWNS.</p>
<p>COUPON:FOUR PERCENT.</p>
<p>MATURITY: TWO-AND-HALF YEARS.</p>
<p>ISS DATE: 17 MARCH 1997</p>
<p>ISS PRICE: TO BE ADVISED</p>
<p>--Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
